accepted only if the note is still at that source revision (otherwise conflict, FR-007), rechecks the caller's rights 
inside the transaction, and atomically writes the summary, appends the accepted items, and creates one version, or 
changes nothing. Suggestions whose description matches an existing item of the note (case- and accent-insensitive) 
