**Applying presence-safety to client lifecycle**
codex
I’m using presence-safety for the browser lifecycle checks. The existing membership invalidation path clears company 
state, but does not automatically clear new note queries or draft callbacks. V3’s server recheck needs a matching 
client rule for late responses after an account or company change.
